      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in 0.0.1</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>First public release of Lotion: a native Mac notes app where every note is a plain Markdown file in a folder you own</li>
          <li>Block editor with slash commands, tables, code blocks with syntax highlighting, Mermaid diagrams, images, videos and embeds</li>
          <li>Publish any note to the web with Lotion Share</li>
